#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:270
#: ca656eaf7ced4101b9feebd96ac1d9af
msgid "Configure ArduPilot"
msgstr "配置 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:272
#: 8c6895a6c65447379d6e7fa8f14c327b
msgid ""
"Connect to the flight controller with a ground station (i.e. Mission "
"Planner) and check that the following parameters are set as shown below:"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接飞行控制器，并确认以下参数按如下设置："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:274
#: aa9be9e8c8524e5691191d87877d4d3e
msgid ":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <copter:AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` = 3 to use EKF3"
msgstr ":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <copter:AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` = 3，使用 EKF3"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:275
#: 0765019d58df407d91575fc95130c66e
msgid ":ref:`EK2_ENABLE <copter:EK2_ENABLE>` = 0 to disable EKF2"
msgstr ":ref:`EK2_ENABLE <copter:EK2_ENABLE>` = 0，禁用 EKF2"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:276
#: 55eb0fe9a4494f69b28d8815529e1f46
msgid ":ref:`EK3_ENABLE <copter:EK3_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable EKF3"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_ENABLE <copter:EK3_ENABLE>` = 1，启用 EKF3"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:277
#: e3ded6e1f03b4d6e91e97347e19bcebf
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <copter:EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` = 6 to set position horizontal"
" source to ExternalNAV"
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <copter:EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` = 6，将水平位置来源设为外部导航（ExternalNAV）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:278
#: c841e5572ba1475dac38817bd58f8279
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <copter:EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` = 1 to set position vertical "
"source to Baro"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <copter:EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` = 1，将垂直位置来源设为气压计"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:279
#: 317f86e3458c4423ab0c2d33c56eb787
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <copter:EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 6 to set velocity horizontal"
" source to ExternalNAV"
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <copter:EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 6，将水平速度来源设为外部导航（ExternalNAV）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:280
#: 2f02dfc1eabe4ae0b15812def08a79a1
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <copter:EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` = 6 to set vertical velocity "
"source to ExternalNAV"
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <copter:EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` = 6，将垂直速度来源设为外部导航（ExternalNAV）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:281
#: d47e3506602c4d8cb923121660718e30
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <copter:EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 6 to set yaw source to "
"ExternalNAV"
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <copter:EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 6，将偏航来源设为外部导航（ExternalNAV）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:282
#: d16ecf0a18cd45ffab124929ae82892f
msgid ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` = 0 to disable the GPS"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` = 0，禁用 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:283
#: f08e7314dae44123a5b59da695a7b919
msgid ":ref:`VISO_TYPE <copter:VISO_TYPE>` = 1 to enable visual odometry"
msgstr ":ref:`VISO_TYPE <copter:VISO_TYPE>` = 1，启用视觉里程计"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:284
#: a462d85602ee427f8979b46fe95cf64f
msgid ""
":ref:`ARMING_SKIPCHK <copter:ARMING_SKIPCHK>` = 8 (optional, to disable GPS "
"checks)"
msgstr ":ref:`ARMING_SKIPCHK <copter:ARMING_SKIPCHK>` = 8（可选，用于禁用 GPS 检查）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:286
#: 3e245ec1850d48bd829486e20ec7ffb1
msgid "After changing any of the values above, reboot the flight controller."
msgstr "更改上述任意参数后，重启飞行控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:288
#: 2b99478e7f1f48eeb1910beb0297df39
msgid ""
"If all is working, vision position estimates should begin flowing in from "
"ROS to ArduPilot.  This can be confirmed by connecting to the flight "
"controller using the Mission Planner (or similar) and check the Flight Data "
"screen's Messages tab (bottom left) for messages from the EKF like below:"
msgstr ""
"若一切正常，视觉位置估计数据应开始从 ROS 流入 ArduPilot。可通过 Mission "
"Planner（或类似工具）连接飞行控制器，在飞行数据界面的「Messages」标签（左下角）中查看 EKF 的如下消息加以确认："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:297
#: d390f2be861d43efaf9bd280c485f175
msgid ""
"Using the Mission Planner (or similar) go to the Flight Data screen and "
"right-mouse-button click on the map and select \"Set Home Here\" >> \"Set "
"EKF Origin\".  The vehicle should appear immediately on the map where you "
"clicked."
msgstr ""
"使用 Mission Planner（或类似工具）进入飞行数据界面，在地图上右键单击并选择「Set Home Here」>>「Set EKF "
"Origin」。飞行器应立即出现在您点击的地图位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:300
#: 14fa27f125f640f8a522362b4238c64c
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:302
#: d4f10dc723f0438aaefda6814186a26b
msgid ""
"To confirm the ROS side is working correctly type the command below and live"
" updates of position estimates from cartographer should be displayed"
msgstr "输入以下命令确认 ROS 端工作正常，应能看到来自 cartographer 的实时位置估计更新"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:312
#: 3a038d644f784a3c844215b6bc1e9145
msgid ""
"Mission Planner's MAVLink Inspector (press Ctrl-F and then press the "
"\"MAVLink Inspector\" button) can be used to check if "
"VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE messages are being successfully sent to the flight "
"controller"
msgstr ""
"可使用 Mission Planner 的 MAVLink 检查器（按 Ctrl-F 然后点击「MAVLink Inspector」按钮）检查 "
"VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE 消息是否成功发送到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:319
#: 7fc12a766b78439c88a5a5f7556e8000
msgid "Video"
msgstr "视频"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-cartographer-slam.rst:326
#: 5ae0356f67a54f799f6e35a24ca4b294
msgid ""
"We are keen to improve ArduPilot's support of ROS so if you find issues "
"(such as commands that do not seem to be supported), please report them in "
"the `ArduPilot issues list "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ with a title that "
"includes \"ROS\" and we will attempt to resolve them as quickly as possible."
msgstr ""
"我们致力于改进 ArduPilot 对 ROS 的支持，若发现问题（如似乎不支持的命令），请在 `ArduPilot 问题列表 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ 中提交，标题包含「ROS」，我们将尽快解决。"
